  "title": "Linda&#39;s Fake and Bake Chicken",
  "description": "This is one of my most requested recipes. It is the best &#39;non-fried&#39; chicken recipe that I&#39;ve tasted. Chicken is battered and breaded, but then baked instead of fried.",
  "authors": [
